  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p>You can demand cooperation from a creature using Intimidate in 1 round (instead of 1 minute), or as a standard action if you invoke one of the creature’s motivations. You can also coerce a creature using Intimidate in only 1 minute (instead of 1d4 × 10 minutes), and such an adjustment lasts 1 day—if you successfully coerce a creature once per day for 1 week (and no Intimidate checks are failed against the creature during this time), the adjustment lasts for 1 month (instead of 2d8 days).</p>\n<p>When you successfully demand cooperation or coerce a creature, they must succeed at a Will save at the end of the duration or have their attitude be unchanged towards you and not report you to the authorities.</p>\n<p><strong>Associated Feats:</strong> Nerve-Racking Negotiator and Threatening Negotiator (<em>Ultimate Intrigue</em>).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bluster#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
